-*   Primitive opacity $\alpha_i$ and transmittance $T_i$ along the ray.
-*   Ray direction $\mathbf{d}$ (or central camera ray for high-parallax scenes).
-
-**Outputs:**
-*   Pixel color $\mathbf{c}$ (and optionally other semantic signals).
